  "story": [
    "Marta <span class=\"hl\">is</span> an industrial electrician in a large factory. Every morning, she <span class=\"hl\">checks</span> the main switchboard and <span class=\"hl\">tests</span> the circuit breakers. She always <span class=\"hl\">wears</span> gloves and safety boots, because the panels <span class=\"hl\">carry</span> a high voltage. If a machine <span class=\"hl\">loses</span> power, the whole production line <span class=\"hl\">stops</span>.",
    "Last week, the team <span class=\"hl\">installed</span> a new control panel. First, Marta <span class=\"hl\">cut</span> the power and <span class=\"hl\">locked</span> the switch. Then she <span class=\"hl\">connected</span> the wires and <span class=\"hl\">tightened</span> each terminal. Finally, an engineer <span class=\"hl\">measured</span> the voltage and <span class=\"hl\">signed</span> the report.",
    "Since Monday, Marta <span class=\"hl\">has replaced</span> four old fuses and <span class=\"hl\">has tested</span> every socket. She <span class=\"hl\">has not found</span> any fault yet, and the line <span class=\"hl\">has run</span> without a single stop. Her supervisor is very happy! 🔧"
